%% showcase: sequenceDiagram autonumber with decimals
%% prose: `autonumber 1.1 0.1` starts numbering at 1.1 and steps by a tenth. As in mermaid, start and step take at most two decimals and each sum is rounded to hundredths, so 1.1 is followed by 1.2, never 1.2000000000000002.
%% approx: Mermaid shrinks the font to fit a long number in its fixed circle; mmd keeps the size and stretches the circle into a pill.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 1.1 0.1
    Alice->>Bob: Hello
    Bob-->>Alice: Hi
    Alice->>Bob: How are you?
    Bob-->>Alice: Fine
